/v1/","context":{"app_id":4758520,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4758520-1846651706690320","game_id":"steam-4758520","kind":"announcement","title":"Fully Steam Deck Compatible","summary":"Did you know that Please File Accurately is fully compatible with the Steam Deck?Controller icons? Yep we show the correct controller icons for the deck, xbox controllers, playstation, some others, and even for keyboard usage. And of course you can always see the controls from the pause menu and help screen.How about tvs? It's been fully tested and working on both the small screen and also when hooked up to a television for up to four players of couch multiplayer. Both the internal controller an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:52:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690320","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758520-1846651706681320","game_id":"steam-4758520","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Map Molten Fields","summary":"We've expanded the demo of Please File Accurately with a third map \"Molten Fields\". Avoid falling in the lava, make coffees to keep your strength up, balance across the pallets, and don't forget to please file accurately.Also in this update are some improvements to the Giant Saws level as we've tweaked some of the balance and swapped out the requirement for coffee with a requirement to keep fed with pizza... but be careful not to burn them!Demo is still a work in progress - more tweaking and tun","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:39:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681320","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758520-1846018067940615","game_id":"steam-4758520","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Track Your Progress","summary":"Small update released today - you can now track your progress and see how well you've done on the two demo levels - one star, two stars, or three stars. How well can you complete the tasks? Or did you get fired again?","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940615","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758520-1846018067926121","game_id":"steam-4758520","kind":"announcement","title":"Please File Accurately Demo Out Now","summary":"The demo for Please File Accurately is now out! Four coworkers stuck in one office. No reason to behave professionally. Complete the tasks, work together, sabotage each other, or destroy the office in this chaotic local 4-player party game.This demo includes two levels from the final game as well as a few of the collectable cosmetics to enjoy straight away. The final game will has a ton more levels... coming soon in Jan 2027.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:29:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4758520-1842846814452815","game_id":"steam-4758520","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo of Please File Accurately is coming soon","summary":"We are working hard to get a demo build out and ready, so you've got something to enjoy between now and January! G